eep even if it's here  through a video or if it's when I'm  meeting you in person if I promise it  it's going to happen I guarantee that  because if I don't keep those promises  I'm not worthy of you guys even giving  me a moment of your time so I know this  got serious I know it did and and I feel  like a hat after the emotions of the  tour and then the the windstorm of  VidCon and coming back for the charity  livestream and just this blur of the  past few weeks and then approaching my  birthday which I think you guys know  that I don't really care about my  birthday I I just want to say this is  the best thing that's ever happened to  me what you guys have given me is the  best thing that's ever happened to me  and I should treat it as such so thank  you everybody so much for watching and  thank you to chika  because Keiko was the hero of the  library because like all that aside the  one individual that made the most  donations was chika because we did a pet  upon and there is an infinite pet dead  she could you mind me putting you up  before with a little cheer a little bit  but chika was the true hero of this  livestream and I owe her a hundred  thousand and every one of you guys  because we do do two movies up there and  you look great Bubba you look like  select add  again hope you know the motive of you  and i'm meaning  100% meaning there is no lie here  there's no false promises here this is  everything so thank you everybody so  much for watching  Thank You chief for being there thank  you my friends who supported me thank  you Bob who flew into town thank you  Alaskan blue jay for staying so strong  and thank you everybody that I met over  this past weekend and as always we will  see you in the next video bye-bye boo  boo boo boo just happy puppy paws on a  puppy OH  [Music]  I mostly don't have don't have even on  telly I don't don't don't  oh no

